Testing the round() function with positive numbers:
round(0.5)   =           1
round(1.5)   =           2
round(2.5)   =           3
round(3.5)   =           4
round(4.5)   =           5
round(5.5)   =           6
round(10.5)  =          11
round(11.5)  =          12
round(12.5)  =          13

Testing the round() function with negative numbers:
round(-0.5)  =          -1
round(-1.5)  =          -2
round(-2.5)  =          -3
round(-3.5)  =          -4
round(-4.5)  =          -5
round(-5.5)  =          -6
round(-10.5) =         -11
round-(11.5) =         -12
round(-12.5) =         -13

